			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 401730201,
					"content": "嗯，不錯，小夥子身體沒什麼毛病，就是飢餓程度比較高，回去多吃點飯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "馬塔拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730202,
					"content": "那太好了，之前我還聽說，有那種出神太久結果身體部位壞死的情況。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "歐洛倫"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730203,
					"content": "這也太可怕了吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730204,
					"content": "嗯，總之勒拉，雖然我們之前不認識，但是現在你沒事就好，我為你高興。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "歐洛倫"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730205,
					"content": "其實，歐洛倫，只是你不認識我而已…我早就聽過你的事情了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "勒拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730206,
					"content": "#還有茜特菈莉大祭司、{NICKNAME}、派蒙，{F#妳}{M#你}們的事蹟我都知道…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "勒拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730207,
					"content": "#欸？居然連我和{NICKNAME}都…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730208,
					"content": "說起來還滿不好意思的，因為你們都是我夢寐以求想要成為的人，但事實證明，我只有仰望你們的分。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "勒拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730209,
					"content": "誰叫我生來就是個靈性白痴呢？哈哈，沒關係，我已經習慣了被忽視的日子了，謝謝你們救了我。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "勒拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730210,
					"content": "歐洛倫，你說的對，也許這就是人生。我之後不會再做這種危險的事、再給大家添麻煩了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "勒拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730211,
					"content": "勒拉先生…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730212,
					"content": "不用安慰我啦，哈哈。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "勒拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730213,
					"content": "喂，你這小鬼在說什麼呢？你好好看看我。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茜特菈莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730214,
					"content": "欸？茜特菈莉大祭司，怎麼了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "勒拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730215,
					"content": "叫你看就仔細看，感覺出來什麼了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茜特菈莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730216,
					"content": "奶奶，妳在說什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "歐洛倫"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730217,
					"content": "#呃…{NICKNAME}，{F#妳}{M#你}說茜特菈莉臉上是不是也寫著「樂於助人」？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730218,
					"content": "等一下…好像…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "勒拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730219,
					"content": "不知道是不是我的錯覺，我覺得茜特菈莉大祭司的身體是虛幻的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "勒拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730220,
					"content": "不…肯定是錯覺，我怎麼可能看出來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "勒拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730221,
					"content": "等等，這種套路…是我用過的那個法術，奶奶的真身已經離我們很遠了，根本就是腳底抹油。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "歐洛倫"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730222,
					"content": "看見了嗎？你已經能察覺到一點靈性的異常了。恭喜你。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茜特菈莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730223,
					"content": "真…真的嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "勒拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730224,
					"content": "不過這是要去哪裡？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "歐洛倫"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730225,
					"content": "笨，當然是釣魚了啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茜特菈莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730226,
					"content": "我留在山洞裡的陷阱被人踩中了，那個叫谷中的傢伙上鉤了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茜特菈莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730227,
					"content": "什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401730228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401730228,
					"content": "閒話之後再聊，來山洞裡找我。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "茜特菈莉"
				}
			]
		},
